   "model": "muse-spark-1.3",
   "outcome_text": "root cause: Hurdle collision disabled (shape.disabled, layer 2 vs mask 1) + player exception lets capsule walk through.\npatch: reset_to_spawn now clears Hurdle exception, forces layer 1 and enables Shape.\nwhy it satisfies: 0.55m solid wall blocks CharacterBody on floor so E(t) stays \u22645px without jumping.\n",
